groundcrew

crewbench/router.py is a Python port of routing logic from
ClipboardHealth/groundcrew (https://github.com/ClipboardHealth/groundcrew) at
commit 32346b9, specifically pickBestAgent, classifyUsageExhaustion and
weeklyPacedBudgetPercentage in src/commands/eligibility.ts.

